{
  "id": "31",
  "document": "静躁独行.txt",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "31:p0",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "$t1 == '31'?\r\n`",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:10691:10706"
    },
    {
      "id": "31:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:10706:10708"
    },
    {
      "id": "31:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“查理？”你朝着黑暗中问了一声。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:10708:10726"
    },
    {
      "id": "31:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“嗯？”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:10726:10732"
    },
    {
      "id": "31:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“这是怎么了？”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:10732:10742"
    },
    {
      "id": "31:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“停电了，我猜。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:10742:10753"
    },
    {
      "id": "31:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "从黑暗中，你听到查理一只手扶着墙、拖着脚步挪动时碰到东西的杂乱声音。他来回拨了几次电灯开关。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:10753:10801"
    },
    {
      "id": "31:p7",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“我觉得这个地方是靠太阳能供电的？”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:10801:10821"
    },
    {
      "id": "31:p8",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“是吧，我猜太阳能也会用完。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:10821:10838"
    },
    {
      "id": "31:p9",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“有备用电源或者什么东西吗？”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:10838:10855"
    },
    {
      "id": "31:p10",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“我不知道。我猜明天早上我得到镇里去给马克打电话问问。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:10855:10885"
    },
    {
      "id": "31:p11",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“哦，那可是太好了。”你把双腿抱到胸口。“好吧，怎样都好。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:10885:10917"
    },
    {
      "id": "31:p12",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "这样的黑暗让你非常不习惯。城市里是没有这样的黑暗的。你把手举到面前，却连轮廓都看不见。焦虑开始在你心中翻腾。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:10917:10973"
    },
    {
      "id": "31:p13",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "如果记录表上的 心碎 或 推卸责任 有至少一项被勾选，则你无法依赖查理的支持。必须转到33。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:10973:11021"
    },
    {
      "id": "31:p14",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要向查理寻求支持，转到 32。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:11021:11038"
    },
    {
      "id": "31:p15",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要就这样睡觉，转到 33。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:11038:11053"
    }
  ]
}
